{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51309","headline":"历山 · 魏炎","name":"历山","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"（齐州城东有孤石，平地耸出，俗谓之历山。\n以北有泉，号舜井。\n东隔小街，又有石井，汲之不绝，云是舜东家之井。\n乾元中有魏炎者，於此题诗曰：）齐州城东舜子郡，邑人虽移井不改。\n时闻汹汹动绿波，犹谓华井中在。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"魏炎","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51309.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51309","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}